1192
00:52:39.910 --> 00:52:44.350
And then they would cue me, and then I would walk in, then I'd have to go back.
然后他们会给我提示，我走进去，然后再退回去。

1193
00:52:44.710 --> 00:52:45.570
So crazy.
太疯狂了。

1194
00:52:45.770 --> 00:52:46.350
So crazy.
太疯狂了。

1195
00:52:46.590 --> 00:52:48.250
