1202
00:53:05.510 --> 00:53:06.690
I don't doubt it.
我不怀疑。

1203
00:53:06.890 --> 00:53:08.270
You have pantyhose toes.
你的连裤袜脚趾露出来了。

1204
00:53:08.270 --> 00:53:13.690
I remember trying to figure out, because once you pick the way you're sitting, you
我记得当时在琢磨，因为一旦你选好了坐姿，你就

