have to sit like that.
必须一直那样坐着。

1206
00:53:14.890 --> 00:53:17.370
You can't shift and move or change your position.
你不能挪动、调整或改变姿势。

1207
00:53:17.610 --> 00:53:19.270
Because it has to match, you guys.
