我们不确定。

1249
00:54:48.830 --> 00:54:50.290
He got straight B's.
他拿的是全B。

1250
00:54:50.510 --> 00:54:51.970
Yeah, but he aced everything.
是啊，但他每门课都考得很好。

1251
00:54:52.170 --> 00:54:52.390
Yeah.
是啊。

1252
00:54:52.850 --> 00:54:59.690
Well, surprise, surprise, this intervention does not result in Meredith deciding to go to rehab.
好吧，不出所料，这次干预并没有让梅雷迪思决定去戒酒。

1253
